                "text": "I\u2019m proud to reintroduce the CHANGE Act, a bipartisan effort to promote early detection and diagnosis of Alzheimer\u2019s and related dementias. By equipping providers with tools for timely intervention, we can improve care, support families, and advance research for a cure. #CHANGEAct #AlzheimersAwareness #EarlyDetection #DementiaCare",
