                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "As an American who has suffered from poor vision since childhood, I have a first-hand understanding of how critical early detection and treatment is when it comes to ensuring that all children have the best possible start in life.  The landmark bill my colleagues and I are pushing will ensure all children get the screening and care they need at the right age by creating the first-ever federally funded program to address children\u2019s vision and eye health. This legislation will empower states and communities, like mine, to improve systems of care for our youngest citizens and their families.",
